      "text": "Ooof"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "7:51 PM",
      "text": "Bad boy"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Mikaela Higgins",
      "time": "7:52 PM",
      "text": "Coach gave him a coaching card. It has stats, projections,  game time decisions,  etc. He tried selling it without permission and got caught by Jay"
